# Track only the journal project in this shared family workspace.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md
!/package.json
!/index.html
!/app.js
!/journal.css
!/styles.css
!/theme.css
!/server.mjs
!/copilot-bridge.mjs
!/COPILOT.md
!/TEST_CASES.md
!/product-plan.md
!/design-exploration-notes.md
!/design-skill-trial.md
!/assets/
/assets/*
!/assets/lucide.min.js
!/assets/lucide-LICENSE.txt
!/assets/life-design.jpg
!/assets/soft-skills.jpg
!/assets/forty-daughter.jpg
!/assets/midlife-road.jpg
!/tests/
/tests/*
!/tests/*.mjs
!/scripts/
/scripts/*
!/scripts/test.mjs
!/scripts/test-preview.mjs
!/.github/
/.github/*
!/.github/workflows/
/.github/workflows/*
!/.github/workflows/test.yml
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/development.md
!/docs/web-test-plan.md
!/docs/test-readiness-report.md
!/docs/recording-regression-report.md
!/docs/visual-accessibility-report.md
!/docs/flomo-import.md
!/docs/issues/
/docs/issues/*
!/docs/issues/*.md
!/output/
/output/*
!/output/seeking-light/
/output/seeking-light/*
!/output/seeking-light/index.html
!/output/seeking-light/journal.css
!/output/seeking-light/journal.js
!/output/seeking-light/flomo-import.js
!/output/seeking-light/server.mjs
!/output/seeking-light/source-audit.mjs
!/output/seeking-light/design-contract.md
!/output/seeking-light/test-report.md

# Defense in depth: never version local diary data or authentication files.
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules/
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
**/diary-export*
**/journal-export*
**/user-data/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
